   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "SgsC5u5wYipTGUIP3NMe",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1385.0,
   "y": 79.0,
   "width": 320.32000000000005,
   "height": 195.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 344007160,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1707826241,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1793932307429,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Normal flow\n1. Client \u2192 firewall published IP\n2. Firewall DNATs to the VIP (on node1)\n3. HAProxy on node1 terminates TLS, adds XFF\n4. Routes by Host to be_app1 / be_app2,\n    each pool = ALL agents\n5. Agent (NGINX + Check Point WAF) inspects\n    and proxies to the app backend\n\nAgent inspects only if host AND port (443)\nmatch the asset \u2192 NGINX on node IP:443.\nkeepalived decides WHICH node has the VIP.",
   "originalText": "Normal flow\n1. Client \u2192 firewall published IP\n2. Firewall DNATs to the VIP (on node1)\n3. HAProxy on node1 terminates TLS, adds XFF\n4. Routes by Host to be_app1 / be_app2,\n    each pool = ALL agents\n5. Agent (NGINX + Check Point WAF) inspects\n    and proxies to the app backend\n\nAgent inspects only if host AND port (443)\nmatch the asset \u2192 NGINX on node IP:443.\nkeepalived decides WHICH node has the VIP.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "KjBNGZuzPD1x8A9mi2oO",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1380.0,
   "y": 320.0,
   "width": 330.0,
   "height": 205.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#5f6368",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
