   "text": "\u2022 Injected: virsh destroy (no TCP reset).\n\u2022 timeout connect 1s + redispatch 1 \u2192 retried on node1.\n\u2022 VIP stays on node1. node2 rejoins by itself after\n   boot.\n\u2022 Measured: 0 failed (6 with connect 3s), gap 1.0 s.",
