   "text": "\u2022 node2 misses VRRP adverts (~3 s) \u2192 MASTER, VIP +\n   gratuitous ARP.\n\u2022 In-flight connections lost (no state sync).\n\u2022 node1 returns as BACKUP (nopreempt).\n\u2022 Measured: 1\u20132 failed, gap 2.2\u20134.2 s.",
