   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 Injected: SIGSTOP (process exists, no answer).\n\u2022 chk_haproxy (curl -m 2) fails \u00d72 \u2192 FAULT \u2192 VIP to\n   node2.\n\u2022 node1's AGENT keeps serving via node2's HAProxy.\n\u2022 Measured: 3 failed, longest gap 6.2 s.",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Injected: SIGSTOP (process exists, no answer).\n\u2022 chk_haproxy (curl -m 2) fails \u00d72 \u2192 FAULT \u2192 VIP to\n   node2.\n\u2022 node1's AGENT keeps serving via node2's HAProxy.\n\u2022 Measured: 3 failed, longest gap 6.2 s.",
