   "text": "\u2022 observe layer7 \u2026 on-error fastinter \u2192 active check\n   every 1 s once errors show \u2192 ejected in 2\u20134 s.\n\u2022 Measured: 6\u201312 \u00d7 503, then 0.\n\u2022 Not mark-down: it would eject ALL agents on backend\n   5xx. Option: retry-on 503.",
