   "text": "\u2022 Injected: cpnano -q on node2 (NGINX keeps running).\n\u2022 XSS via node1 \u2192 403, via node2 \u2192 200: NOT inspected.\n   HAProxy still sends node2 50 %.\n\u2022 Detect via portal agent status / cpnano -s / attack\n   probe.",
